# ^LicenseText
Fadlan dib u eeg heshiiska shatiga ka hor intaadan rakibin $(^NameDA). Haddii aad aqbasho dhammaan shuruudaha heshiiska, dhagsii I Agree.
# ^LicenseTextCB
Fadlan dib u eeg heshiiska shatiga ka hor intaadan rakibin $(^NameDA). Haddii aad aqbasho dhammaan shuruudaha heshiiska, dhagsii sanduuqa calaamadaynta ee hoose. $_CLICK
# ^LicenseTextRB
Fadlan dib u eeg heshiiska shatiga ka hor intaadan rakibin $(^NameDA). Haddii aad aqbasho dhammaan shuruudaha heshiiska, dooro doorashada koowaad ee hoose. $_CLICK
# ^UnLicenseText
Fadlan dib u eeg heshiiska shatiga ka hor intaanad dajin $(^NameDA). Haddii aad aqbasho dhammaan shuruudaha heshiiska, dhagsii I Agree.
